{"4601480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spin To Breathe", "steam_appid": 4601480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random? We call it a rush!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run throws new items and wild conditions at you. Adapt to whatever Lady Luck has in store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No engineering degree required</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack open and upgrade your slot machine. If it buys you even 10 more minutes, it's worth it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay for air!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget standard bets. Every breath costs money. The less oxygen left, the higher the price!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stakes cranked to the max</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got nothing to lose except your life! Will you risk it all, hit the jackpot, and survive until rescue, or suffocate from greed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're not alone in this casino</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take calls from other customers and help with their requests. A timely helping hand always pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cardboard bartender cutout or a robot vacuum… They're great company when you're losing your mind within four walls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin in style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your slot machine, cover it in stickers, and don't forget to snap a photo to remember it by!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random? We call it a rush!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run throws new items and wild conditions at you. Adapt to whatever Lady Luck has in store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No engineering degree required</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack open and upgrade your slot machine. If it buys you even 10 more minutes, it's worth it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pay for air!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget standard bets. Every breath costs money. The less oxygen left, the higher the price!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stakes cranked to the max</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've got nothing to lose except your life! Will you risk it all, hit the jackpot, and survive until rescue, or suffocate from greed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're not alone in this casino</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take calls from other customers and help with their requests. A timely helping hand always pays off!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cardboard bartender cutout or a robot vacuum… They're great company when you're losing your mind within four walls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spin in style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your slot machine, cover it in stickers, and don't forget to snap a photo to remember it by!</p>", "short_description": "Pay for air to stay alive! Spin the reels to the sound of explosions while space pirates raid your casino. Build your slot machine piece by piece and hold out until rescue arrives!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601480/526ccaafd6af7e20bd0aa6b671c05813b7097f0f/header.jpg?t=1785835174", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4601480/12dbc8478bb2b48c155021c894a358df8b4d956f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=178